"7":{"tp":"단항식 계산","key":"각각 계산","sol":["① $35a^4b$ ② $36a^3b^5$ ④ $-8a^4b$ ⑤ $-\\frac{32a^2}{b^3}$","③ $10a^4b^3\\times\\frac{5}{2a^3b}=25ab^2$ 옳다"],"check":"ok"},
