"10":{"tp":"물의 높이","key":"부피 같음","sol":["삼각기둥 부피 $\\frac{1}{2}\\times a\\times(4b+1)\\times3a=\\frac{3}{2}a^2(4b+1)$","직육면체 밑넓이 $3a\\times2a=6a^2$","높이 $=\\frac{3a^2(4b+1)}{2\\times6a^2}=b+\\frac{1}{4}$"],"check":"ok"},
